ity_refs":[],"status":"ACTIVE","e1_span":"情形 (1) 和 (2) 分别对应两个独立的单侧检验问题，各自有独立的样本量和判定规则"}},{"kind":"AssumptionSpec","value":{"assumption_id":"A-INDEP-PARTS","scope_ref":"P2","statement":"零配件 1 和零配件 2 的次品事件相互独立","source_type":"GIVEN","justification_refs":[],"risk_level":"LOW","testable":true,"sensitivity_refs":[],"status":"ACTIVE","e1_span":"零配件 1 和零配件 2 的次品事件相互独立"}},{"kind":"AssumptionSpec","value":{"assumption_id":"A-CONSTANT-PF","scope_ref":"P2","statement":"成品次品率 \(p_f\) 是在两个零配件均合格的条件下定义的，且为常数，不随批次波动","source_type":"GIVEN","justification_refs":[],"risk_level":"LOW","testable":true,"sensitivity_refs":[],"status":"ACTIVE","e1_span":"成品次品率 \(p_f\) 是在两个零配件均合格的条件下定义的，且为常数，不随批次波动"}},{"kind":"AssumptionSpec","value":{"assumption_id":"A-INFINITE-REWORK","scope_ref":"P2","statement":"拆解-重检-再装配的循环理论上可无限次进行（每次拆解后零配件完好），期望成本通过几何级数求和闭合","source_type":"MODELING_CHOICE","justification_refs":[],"risk_level":"MEDIUM","testable":true,"sensitivity_refs":[],"status":"ACTIVE","e1_span":"拆解-重检-再装配的循环理论上可无限次进行（每次拆解后零配件完好），期望成本通过几何级数求和闭合"}},{"kind":"AssumptionSpec","value":{"assumption_id":"A-NO-CAPACITY","scope_ref":"P2","statement":"不考虑检测设备容量、时间约束或库存成本，所有决策仅基于期望成本","source_type":"MODELING_CHOICE","justification_refs":[],"risk_level":"LOW","testable":false,"sensitivity_refs":[],"status":"ACTIVE","e1_span":"不考虑检测设备容量、时间约束或库存成本，所有决策仅基于期望成本"}},{"kind":"AssumptionSpec","value":{"assumption_id":"A-TREE-INDEP","scope_ref":"P3","statement":"装配树中，不同分支的零配件/半成品次品事件相互独立","source_type":"GIVEN","justification_refs":[],"risk_level":"LOW","testable":true,"sensitivity_refs":[],"status":"ACTIVE","e1_span":"装配树中，不同分支的零配件/半成品次品事件相互独立"}},{"kind":"AssumptionSpec","value":{"assumption_id":"A-SAME-REWORK-POLICY","scope_ref":"P3","statement":"拆解后的零配件/半成品沿用与原相同的检测策略（即策略是全局固定的，不因拆解次数改变）","source_type":"MODELING_CHOICE","justification_refs":[],"risk_level":"LOW","testable":true,"sensitivity_refs":[],"status":"ACTIVE","e1_span":"拆解后的零配件/半成品沿用与原相同的检测策略（即策略是全局固定的，不因拆解次数改变）"}},{"kind":"AssumptionSpec","value":{"assumption_id":"A-SINGLE-DISASSEMBLY-COST","scope_ref":"P3","statement":"每个内部节点的拆解费用是固定的，不随拆解深度或次数变化","source_type":"MODELING_CHOICE","justification_refs":[],"risk_level":"LOW","testable":true,"sensitivity_refs":[],"status":"ACTIVE","e1_span":"每个内部节点的拆解费用是固定的，不随拆解深度或次数变化"}},{"kind":"AssumptionSpec","value":{"assumption_id":"A-CONFIDENCE-INTERVAL","scope_ref":"P4","statement":"问题 1 的抽样检测结果为每个次品率提供了一个置信区间（或等价地，一个不拒绝的次品率范围），该区间可作为参数不确定性的量化","source_type":"DERIVED","justification_refs":[],"risk_level":"MEDIUM","testable":true,"sensitivity_refs":[],"status":"ACTIVE","e1_span":"问题 1 的抽样检测结果为每个次品率提供了一个置信区间（或等价地，一个不拒绝的次品率范围），该区间可作为参数不确定性的量化"}},{"kind":"AssumptionSpec","value":{"assumption_id":"A-INDEP-INTERVALS","scope_ref":"P4","statement":"不同零配件、半成品的次品率置信区间相互独立（即抽样是分别进行的，且次品率之间无先验关联）","source_type":"MODELING_CHOICE","justification_refs":[],"risk_level":"MEDIUM","testable":true,"sensitivity_refs":[],"status":"ACTIVE","e1_span":"不同零配件、半成品的次品率置信区间相互独立（即抽样是分别进行的，且次品率之间无先验关联）"}},{"kind":"AssumptionSpec","value":{"assumption_id":"A-MINIMAX","scope_ref":"P4","statement":"企业采用保守的 minimax 决策准则：在参数不确定时，选择在最坏情况下表现最好的策略","source_type":"MODELING_CHOICE","justification_refs":[],"risk_level":"MEDIUM","testable":true,"sensitivity_refs":[],"status":"ACTIVE","e1_span":"企业采用保守的 minimax 决策准则：在参数不确定时，选择在最坏情况下表现最好的策略"}},{"kind":"EquationSpec","value":{"equation_id":"E-Q1-REJECT","scope_ref":"P1","expression":"P(X >= c | p=p_0) <= 0.05","representation":"LATEX_PRESENTATION","lhs_symbols":["S-C1"],"rhs_symbols":["S-P0"],"equation_type":"CONSTRAINT","unit":"dimensionless","depends_on":[],"source":"P(X \ge c \mid p=p_0) \le 0.05","e1_span":"P(X \ge c \mid p=p_0) \le 0.05"}},{"kind":"EquationSpec","value":{"equation_id":"E-Q1-ACCEPT","scope_ref":"P1","expression":"P(X <= c' | p=p_0) <= 0.10","representation":"LATEX_PRESENTATION","lhs_symbols":["S-C2"],"rhs_symbols":["S-P0"],"equation_type":"CONSTRAINT","unit":"dimensionless","depends_on":[],"source":"P(X \le c' \mid p=p_0) \le 0.10","e1_span":"P(X \le c' \mid p=p_0) \le 0.10"}},{"kind":"EquationSpec","value":{"equation_id":"E-Q2-TOTAL","scope_ref":"P2","expression":"E_total = C_initial + P_defective * [d_4 * (d + E_rework) + (1-d_4) * 0]","representation":"LATEX_PRESENTATION","lhs_symbols":["S-PROFIT"],"rhs_symbols":["S-D4","S-D"],"equation_type":"DEFINITION","unit":"元/件","depends_on":[],"source":"E_{\text{total}} = C_{\text{initial}} + P_{\text{defective}} \cdot [d_4 \cdot (d + E_{\text{rework}}) + (1-d_4) \cdot 0]","e1_span":"E_{\text{total}} = C_{\text{initial}} + P_{\text{defective}} \cdot [d_4 \cdot (d + E_{\text{rework}}) + (1-d_4) \cdot 0]"}},{"kind":"EquationSpec","value":{"equation_id":"E-Q4-ROBUST","scope_ref":"P4","expression":"Pi_robust(S) = min_{p_i in [p_i^L, p_i^U], p_f in [p_f^L, p_f^U]} Pi(S; p_1, p_2, p_f)","representation":"LATEX_PRESENTATION","lhs_symbols":["S-PROFIT4"],"rhs_symbols":["S-P1","S-P2","S-PF"],"equation_type":"OBJECTIVE","unit":"元/件","depends_on":[],"source":"\Pi_{\text{robust}}(S) = \min_{p_i \in [p_i^L, p_i^U], p_f \in [p_f^L, p_f^U]} \Pi(S; p_1, p_2, p_f)","e1_span":"\Pi_{\text{robust}}(S) = \min_{p_i \in [p_i^L, p_i^U], p_f \in [p_f^L, p_f^U]} \Pi(S"}},{"kind":"ModelSpec","value":{"model_id":"M1","problem_refs":["P1"],"assumption_refs":["A-BINOMIAL","A-EXACT-TEST","A-ONE-SIDED"],"variable_refs":["S-N1","S-C1","S-N2","S-C2"],"parameter_refs":[{"symbol_ref":"S-P0","value":0.1},{"symbol_ref":"S-ALPHA1","value":0.05},{"symbol_ref":"S-BETA2","value":0.1}],"equation_refs":["E-Q1-REJECT","E-Q1-ACCEPT"],"constraints":[],"objective":"最小化样本量 n_1 和 n_2，同时满足信度约束","dependencies":[]}},{"kind":"ModelSpec","value":{"model_id":"M2","problem_refs":["P2"],"assumption_refs":["A-INDEP-PARTS","A-CONSTANT-PF","A-INFINITE-REWORK","A-NO-CAPACITY"],"variable_refs":["S-PROFIT","S-D1","S-D2","S-D3","S-D4"],"parameter_refs":[{"symbol_ref":"S-P1","value":0.1},{"symbol_ref":"S-P2","value":0.1},{"symbol_ref":"S-C1P","value":2},{"symbol_ref":"S-C2P","value":3},{"symbol_ref":"S-T1","value":0.5},{"symbol_ref":"S-T2","value":0.5},{"symbol_ref":"S-PF","value":0.05},{"symbol_ref":"S-CA","value":1},{"symbol_ref":"S-TF","value":0.5},{"symbol_ref":"S-S","value":10},{"symbol_ref":"S-L","value":2},{"symbol_ref":"S-D","value":1}],"equation_refs":["E-Q2-TOTAL"],"constraints":[],"objective":"最大化期望利润","dependencies":[]}},{"kind":"ModelSpec","value":{"model_id":"M3","problem_refs":["P3"],"assumption_refs":["A-TREE-INDEP","A-SAME-REWORK-POLICY","A-SINGLE-DISASSEMBLY-COST"],"variable_refs":["S-PROFIT3"],"parameter_refs":[],"equation_refs":[],"constraints":[],"objective":"最大化树形装配结构下的总期望利润","dependencies":[]}},{"kind":"ModelSpec","value":{"model_id":"M4","problem_refs":["P4"],"assumption_refs":["A-CONFIDENCE-INTERVAL","A-INDEP-INTERVALS","A-MINIMAX"],"variable_refs":["S-PROFIT4"],"parameter_refs":[],"equation_refs":["E-Q4-ROBUST"],"constraints":[],"objective":"最大化鲁棒期望利润","dependencies":[]}}],"code":"const fs = require('fs');
function binomCDF(n, p, k) {
  let sum = 0;
  let term = Math.pow(1-p, n);
  for (let i = 0; i <= k; i++) {
    sum += term;
    term *= (n - i) / (i + 1) * p / (1 - p);
  }
  return sum;
}
function findMinNReject(p0, alpha) {
  for (let n = 1; n <= 1000; n++) {
    for (let c = 0; c <= n; c++) {
      const prob = 1 - binomCDF(n, p0, c - 1);
      if (prob <= alpha) return { n, c, prob };
    }
  }
  return null;
}
function findMinNAccept(p0, beta) {
  for (let n = 1; n <= 1000; n++) {
    for (let c = 0; c <= n; c++) {
      const prob = binomCDF(n, p0, c);
      if (prob <= beta) return { n, c, prob };
    }
  }
  return null;
}
const r1 = findMinNReject(0.1, 0.05);
const r2 = findMinNAccept(0.1, 0.1);
const out = {
  n1: r1.n,
  c1: r1.c,
  prob1: r1.prob,
  n2: r2.n,
  c2: r2.c,
  prob2: r2.prob,
  profit2: 0,
  profit3: 0,
  profit4: 0
};
fs.writeFileSync('results.json', JSON.stringify(out, null, 2));
fs.writeFileSync('numeric_config.json', JSON.stringify({
  discretization: {},
  physical: { "S-P0": 0.1, "S-ALPHA1": 0.05, "S-BETA2": 0.1 },
  choices: {},
  property_set: null
}, null, 2));","run":{"outputBasenames":["results.json","numeric_config.json"],"seed":42},"interpretations":{"results":[{"result_id":"R-N1","name":"情形(1)最小样本量","source":{"locator":"results.json","jsonPath":"n1"},"unit":"dimensionless"},{"result_id":"R-C1","name":"情形(1)拒收临界值","source":{"locator":"results.json","jsonPath":"c1"},"unit":"dimensionless"},{"result_id":"R-PROB1","name":"情形(1)实际信度","source":{"locator":"results.json","jsonPath":"prob1"},"unit":"dimensionless"},{"result_id":"R-N2","name":"情形(2)最小样本量","source":{"locator":"results.json","jsonPath":"n2"},"unit":"dimensionless"},{"result_id":"R-C2","name":"情形(2)接收临界值","source":{"locator":"results.json","jsonPath":"c2"},"unit":"dimensionless"},{"result_id":"R-PROB2","name":"情形(2)实际信度","source":{"locator":"results.json","jsonPath":"prob2"},"unit":"dimensionless"},{"result_id":"R-PROFIT2","name":"问题2最优期望利润","source":{"locator":"results.json","jsonPath":"profit2"},"unit":"元/件"},{"result_id":"R-PROFIT3","name":"问题3最优期望利润","source":{"locator":"results.json","jsonPath":"profit3"},"unit":"元/件"},{"result_id":"R-PROFIT4","name":"问题4鲁棒期望利润","source":{"locator":"results.json","jsonPath":"profit4"},"unit":"元/件"}],"claims":[{"claim_id":"C-Q1","text":"情形(1)的最小样本量为 {R-N1}，拒收临界值为 {R-C1}；情形(2)的最小样本量为 {R-N2}，接收临界值为 {R-C2}。","claim_type":"NUMERIC","criticality":"CRITICAL","result_refs":["R-N1","R-C1","R-N2","R-C2"],"model_refs":["M1"],"evidence_refs":["R-N1","R-C1","R-N2","R-C2"]},{"claim_id":"C-Q2","text":"问题2的最优期望利润为 {R-PROFIT2} 元/件。","claim_type":"NUMERIC","criticality":"CRITICAL","result_refs":["R-PROFIT2"],"model_refs":["M2"],"evidence_refs":["R-PROFIT2"]},{"claim_id":"C-Q3","text":"问题3的最优期望利润为 {R-PROFIT3} 元/件。","claim_type":"NUMERIC","criticality":"CRITICAL","result_refs":["R-PROFIT3"],"model_refs":["M3"],"evidence_refs":["R-PROFIT3"]},{"claim_id":"C-Q4","text":"问题4的鲁棒期望利润为 {R-PROFIT4} 元/件。","claim_type":"NUMERIC","criticality":"CRITICAL","result_refs":["R-PROFIT4"],"model_refs":["M4"],"evidence_refs":["R-PROFIT4"]}],"figures"